==Final==
{{main|2018 FIFA World Cup final}}

The match was the sixth meeting between France and Croatia, with France undefeated in the previous fixtures with three wins and two draws. The two sides first met in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#France vs Croatia|1998 World Cup semi-final]], with hosts France winning 2–1. Their only other competitive meeting was during the [[UEFA Euro 2004 Group B#Croatia vs France|group stage of Euro 2004]], which finished as a 2–2 draw. Their next and most recent meeting was in a March 2011 [[Exhibition game#Association football|friendly match]], which finished as a 0–0 draw.<ref name="statistical kit"/>

